  "reviewMethod": "Root independently actually read all 189 complete five-field bilingual pairs alongside full frozen POS, meanings, variants and lexical evidence in three untruncated show-review-pack ranges 0..62,63..125,126..188. Each selected sense, actual grammatical function, idiomatic use, scope of translation and neutral scene was individually assessed. Four narrow precision findings were returned to author B. After the author's revision, root actually reread every final changed pair and its entire frozen object in show-precision-delta: get in on participates in a project with natural Chinese, hard by is a true adverb without NP complement, hold onto explicitly crosses a road, and jack-knife selects the intransitive vehicle-folding sense rather than mislabelling causation as part of that verb meaning. All 185 other complete five-field rows were independently byte/row-verified unchanged from the fully read initial source; no unexamined language revision is covered. Genuine independent AI selected-sense review, not a mechanical approval or human/exhaustive lexical certification."
